Alembic migrations for TheraGraph.

The database URL comes from application settings (alembic/env.py), not alembic.ini.

    make migrate                     # alembic upgrade head
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add x"
    alembic downgrade -1
    alembic upgrade head --sql       # print SQL without executing

Always review an autogenerated migration: Alembic cannot infer data migrations, and it
renders a renamed column as a drop plus an add.
